  "transcript": [
    {
      "id": "caption-1",
      "start": 0.089,
      "end": 5.5,
      "text": "The simpleshow explains the offside rule.",
      "source": "imported_caption"
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-2",
      "start": 5.5,
      "end": 7.9,
      "text": "This is Philip.",
      "source": "imported_caption"
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-3",
      "start": 7.9,
      "end": 10.8,
      "text": "He‘s a passionate football fan who, with his friends,",
      "source": "imported_caption"
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-4",
      "start": 10.8,
      "end": 15.5,
      "text": "watches every game that their favourite teams play.",
      "source": "imported_caption"
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-5",
      "start": 15.5,
      "end": 17.7,
      "text": "And this is Philip’s girlfriend Marie.",
      "source": "imported_caption"
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-6",
      "start": 17.7,
      "end": 20.65,
      "text": "The two are totally in love,",
      "source": "imported_caption"
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-7",
      "start": 20.65,
      "end": 24.029,
      "text": "but there is one issue that can cause tension between the pair:",
      "source": "imported_caption"
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-8",
      "start": 24.029,
      "end": 28.5,
      "text": "Marie never comes along to the stadium because she doesn’t understand the rules.",
      "source": "imported_caption"
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-9",
      "start": 28.5,
      "end": 31.349,
      "text": "Especially the offside rule –",
      "source": "imported_caption"
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-10",
      "start": 31.349,
      "end": 35.12,
      "text": "it‘s waaaaay too complicated. What is it anyway?",
      "source": "imported_caption"
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-11",
      "start": 35.12,
      "end": 38.46,
      "text": "Philip draws a football pitch.",
      "source": "imported_caption"
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-12",
      "start": 38.46,
      "end": 41.66,
      "text": "He‘s the goalkeeper and his mates are the defenders.",
      "source": "imported_caption"
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-13",
      "start": 41.66,
      "end": 46.07,
      "text": "Marie and her friend are the strikers on the opposing team.",
      "source": "imported_caption"
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-14",
      "start": 46.07,
      "end": 50.149,
      "text": "If at some point Marie passes the ball to her friend",
      "source": "imported_caption"
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-15",
      "start": 50.149,
      "end": 54.16,
      "text": "who happens to be standing closer to Philip’s goal than one of his defenders,",
      "source": "imported_caption"
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-16",
      "start": 54.16,
      "end": 57.789,
      "text": "that’s offside. A goal scored in this situation",
      "source": "imported_caption"
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-17",
      "start": 57.789,
      "end": 59.5,
      "text": "would be disallowed.",
      "source": "imported_caption"
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-18",
      "start": 59.5,
      "end": 62,
      "text": "It would be allowed if Marie’s friend was standing anywhere",
      "source": "imported_caption"
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-19",
      "start": 62,
      "end": 64.299,
      "text": "on the same line as the defender.",
      "source": "imported_caption"
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-20",
      "start": 64.299,
      "end": 68.17,
      "text": "Philip also explains that the offside rule doesn’t always apply,",
      "source": "imported_caption"
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-21",
      "start": 68.17,
      "end": 71.54,
      "text": "for example if Marie’s friend had the ball passed to her while she was still",
      "source": "imported_caption"
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-22",
      "start": 71.54,
      "end": 73.86,
      "text": "standing in her own half.",
      "source": "imported_caption"
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-23",
      "start": 73.86,
      "end": 78.4,
      "text": "Marie is thrilled and now accompanies Philip to a game.",
      "source": "imported_caption"
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-24",
      "start": 78.4,
      "end": 81.46,
      "text": "The lovely Marie is quickly surrounded by his football buddies.",
      "source": "imported_caption"
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-25",
      "start": 81.46,
      "end": 85.6,
      "text": "Suddenly Philip is the one caught out by the offside trap.",
      "source": "imported_caption"
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-26",
      "start": 85.6,
      "end": 88.17,
      "text": "Time to get back on the ball!",
      "source": "imported_caption"
    }
  ],
